            "review_title": "Review at Pho Bo Uc 5 Vien",
            "review_text": "Adam B\nMelbourne, Australia40 contributions\n0\nWorst restaurant in Nha Trang!!\nSep 2017 • Family\nWe don't expect much, but this place literally takes the cake. We sat down as a family and ordered several bowls of Pho and drinks, the waitress repeated our order back - all in Vietnamese. 20 minutes later half of our table was still waiting for food and drinks, the waitress then started arguing and claimed we didn't order enough despite having it written down! We were then told they were all out of Pho (this is a Pho restaurant at 6pm!!), we paid the bill and as we were walking out they were serving other customers Pho! The food they actually managed to serve was horrible! Avoid this place!!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 2, 2017",
